# game/a2s1.rpy:578
translate spanish a2s1_908d8094:

    # "\"GET UP!\""
    "\"¡LEVANTAOS!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:579
translate spanish a2s1_e400313c:

    # "I jump at the same time I feel Amicus jolt against me."
    "Doy un respingo al mismo tiempo que siento a Amicus sobresaltarse contra mí."

# game/a2s1.rpy:580
translate spanish a2s1_453ae743:

    # "We both struggle to sit up while pulling the covers up around us."
    "Los dos intentamos incorporarnos mientras subimos las mantas a nuestro alrededor."

# game/a2s1.rpy:582
translate spanish a2s1_6426b57d:

    # ca "\"OUT OF THE BED!\""
    ca "\"¡FUERA DE LA CAMA!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:583
translate spanish a2s1_fc332a72:

    # "The jarring appearance of Cato has me staring at him in surprise, unsure of what to do."
    "La brusca aparición de Cato me hace mirarlo sorprendido, sin saber qué hacer."

# game/a2s1.rpy:584
translate spanish a2s1_17b27363:

    # "Amicus immediately moves though, pulling me off the bed with him, standing slightly in front of me as he hands me the blanket to cover myself up."
    "Pero Amicus se mueve de inmediato y me baja de la cama con él; se coloca un poco delante de mí mientras me da la manta para cubrirme."

# game/a2s1.rpy:585
translate spanish a2s1_f8dc8bf1:

    # "We both stare at Cato, the old wolf actually shaking with fury."
    "Los dos miramos a Cato; el viejo lobo está temblando de furia."

# game/a2s1.rpy:586
translate spanish a2s1_a679960c:

    # ca "\"Make yourself decent, Amicus.\""
    ca "\"Ponte presentable, Amicus.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:587
translate spanish a2s1_8df228d6:

    # "Amicus hurriedly snatches up underwear from the dresser, giving me one of my own as well."
    "Amicus recoge apresuradamente ropa interior de la cómoda y me da también una de las mías."

# game/a2s1.rpy:588
translate spanish a2s1_5337a536:

    # "As I'm struggling to tie mine on, I notice Cassius standing in the doorway, something shiny and flashing with lights in his paw."
    "Mientras intento atármela, noto a Cassius en la puerta, con algo brillante y lleno de luces intermitentes en la pata."

# game/a2s1.rpy:589
translate spanish a2s1_58d7a0d9:

    # "He doesn't have the usual sour look on his face though."
    "Pero no tiene su expresión agria habitual."

# game/a2s1.rpy:590
translate spanish a2s1_3e017342:

    # "Instead, he almost looks scared."
    "En cambio, casi parece asustado."

# game/a2s1.rpy:591
translate spanish a2s1_30216102:

    # "Cato lets us stand in silence for a moment before turning his head toward the door."
    "Cato nos deja allí en silencio un momento antes de volver la cabeza hacia la puerta."

# game/a2s1.rpy:592
translate spanish a2s1_b173796b:

    # ca "\"Felix! Enter!\""
    ca "\"¡Felix! ¡Entra!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:593
translate spanish a2s1_00016bcb:

    # "I hear shuffling around out in the hallway and Cassius moves to the side to allow a neatly-robed wolf to enter."
    "Oigo movimientos en el pasillo y Cassius se aparta para dejar entrar a un lobo con una túnica bien arreglada."

# game/a2s1.rpy:594
translate spanish a2s1_321b1550:

    # "He looks about as old as Cato, though nowhere near as big."
    "Parece más o menos tan viejo como Cato, aunque ni de lejos tan grande."

# game/a2s1.rpy:595
translate spanish a2s1_8cbee3c2:

    # "He moves timidly, looking about with his ears down."
    "Se mueve con timidez y mira a su alrededor con las orejas bajas."

# game/a2s1.rpy:596
translate spanish a2s1_7e31dc94:

    # "Felix" "\"Y—yes, your Imperial Majesty?\""
    "Felix" "\"¿S—sí, vuestra majestad imperial?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:597
translate spanish a2s1_7d2029ee:

    # ca "\"Is that the alien you treated for avian pox?\""
    ca "\"¿Es ese el alienígena al que trataste por viruela aviar?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:598
translate spanish a2s1_9badfd85:

    # "Cato jerks his head at me, keeping his eyes on Felix."
    "Cato me señala con un brusco movimiento de cabeza, sin apartar los ojos de Felix."

# game/a2s1.rpy:599
translate spanish a2s1_0cf0feb3:

    # "Felix turns to look at me, and I can tell that he's trying to think of the right thing to say."
    "Felix se vuelve hacia mí y veo que intenta pensar qué decir."

# game/a2s1.rpy:600
translate spanish a2s1_81c13580:

    # "Finally, he just gulps and nods his head."
    "Al final solo traga saliva y asiente."

# game/a2s1.rpy:601
translate spanish a2s1_477c4f6c:

    # "Felix" "\"Yes, I treated him three nights ago for avian pox.\""
    "Felix" "\"Sí, lo traté hace tres noches por viruela aviar.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:602
translate spanish a2s1_d7fd4423:

    # ca "\"And his species had no profile?\""
    ca "\"¿Y no había un perfil de su especie?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:603
translate spanish a2s1_8303c843:

    # "Felix" "\"N—no, I could only tell that he was a primate...how...how is he conscious—\""
    "Felix" "\"N—no, solo pude determinar que era un primate... cómo... cómo está consciente—\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:604
translate spanish a2s1_1266095f:

    # ca "\"Com, escort Felix to the dungeons.\""
    ca "\"Com, escolta a Felix a las mazmorras.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:606
translate spanish a2s1_eefe4817:

    # com "\"Yes, Cato\""
    com "\"Sí, Cato\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:607
translate spanish a2s1_a1ee88df:

    # "Felix" "\"What? Why!? Why to the dungeons...Your Majesty?\""
    "Felix" "\"¿Qué? ¿¡Por qué!? ¿Por qué a las mazmorras... vuestra majestad?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:608
translate spanish a2s1_bdf59f1d:

    # "Felix looks imploringly at Cato before the probes enter."
    "Felix mira a Cato con expresión suplicante antes de que entren las sondas."

# game/a2s1.rpy:609
translate spanish a2s1_e28456c5:

    # com "\"Proceed to the hall or risk being shot, Felix.\""
    com "\"Dirígete al pasillo o te expones a recibir un disparo, Felix.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:610
translate spanish a2s1_96887a46:

    # "Felix" "\"Please, what is happening?\""
    "Felix" "\"Por favor, ¿qué está pasando?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:611
translate spanish a2s1_b51f9c67:

    # "Even while he speaks, Felix backs away out of the room, Cato completely ignoring him."
    "Mientras habla, Felix retrocede fuera de la habitación; Cato lo ignora por completo."

# game/a2s1.rpy:612
translate spanish a2s1_07248ae5:

    # "We all listen to the doctor's stumbling steps out in the echoing hall, the wolf making an attempt to ask Cassius what's happening before things fall silent again."
    "Todos escuchamos los pasos vacilantes del médico en el pasillo resonante; el lobo intenta preguntarle a Cassius qué ocurre antes de que vuelva el silencio."

# game/a2s1.rpy:613
translate spanish a2s1_513bde08:

    # ca "\"Cassius, come in and close the door.\""
    ca "\"Cassius, entra y cierra la puerta.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:616
translate spanish a2s1_fdc61f8a:

    # "Cassius, looking even more scared now, steps inside and allows the door to close."
    "Cassius, aún más asustado, entra y deja que la puerta se cierre."

# game/a2s1.rpy:617
translate spanish a2s1_5aafb82e:

    # "Cato stares at the two of us."
    "Cato nos mira fijamente a los dos."

# game/a2s1.rpy:618
translate spanish a2s1_2a343048:

    # "At this point, Amicus has one paw on my arm, keeping me firmly halfway behind his back."
    "Ahora Amicus tiene una pata en mi brazo y me mantiene firmemente a medio ocultar detrás de su espalda."

# game/a2s1.rpy:619
translate spanish a2s1_493cc6eb:

    # "I'm still able to look around his shoulder at the furious acting emperor."
    "Todavía puedo mirar por encima de su hombro al furioso emperador en funciones."

# game/a2s1.rpy:620
translate spanish a2s1_ed7f284d:

    # "Slowly, I'm starting to realize what might be happening right now, and Cato's next words confirm it."
    "Poco a poco empiezo a comprender lo que puede estar ocurriendo y las siguientes palabras de Cato lo confirman."

# game/a2s1.rpy:622
translate spanish a2s1_9873b79a:

    # ca "\"Amicus...did you make First Contact?\""
    ca "\"Amicus... ¿estableciste un Primer Contacto?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:623
translate spanish a2s1_a8bb45f1:

    # "Amicus is silent for a beat, but responds in a strong, confident voice."
    "Amicus guarda silencio un instante, pero responde con voz firme y segura."

# game/a2s1.rpy:625
translate spanish a2s1_3377036d:

    # a "\"No, of course not. What in the world are you talking about, Cato?\""
    a "\"No, por supuesto que no. ¿De qué demonios hablas, Cato?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:626
translate spanish a2s1_c5a4f885:

    # "Cato stares, jaw clenched, then screams at us at a volume I didn't think he was capable of."
    "Cato lo mira, con la mandíbula apretada; después nos grita a un volumen del que no creía que fuera capaz."

# game/a2s1.rpy:630
translate spanish a2s1_d3478a4f:

    # ca "\"DO NOT PLAY GAMES WITH ME AMICUS!\""
    ca "\"¡NO JUEGUES CONMIGO, AMICUS!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:631
translate spanish a2s1_188e6a67:

    # "To his credit, Amicus only jumps a little bit, his grip still firmly on my arm."
    "A su favor, Amicus solo da un pequeño respingo y mantiene la pata firme en mi brazo."

# game/a2s1.rpy:632
translate spanish a2s1_450bf4ee:

    # "The silence that follows rings in my ears as Cato seems to work to calm himself down."
    "El silencio que sigue me retumba en los oídos mientras Cato parece esforzarse por calmarse."

# game/a2s1.rpy:633
translate spanish a2s1_e0d0de33:

    # "When he speaks again, his voice is barely above a whisper."
    "Cuando vuelve a hablar, su voz apenas supera un susurro."

# game/a2s1.rpy:635
translate spanish a2s1_9b460064:

    # ca "\"He is un-profiled. ALL children, abandoned or not, are profiled. He is not a Simian, so WHAT is he?\""
    ca "\"No tiene perfil. TODOS los Hijos, abandonados o no, tienen uno. No es un simiano, así que ¿QUÉ es?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:636
translate spanish a2s1_d06cc8c0:

    # "Amicus is frozen, and I feel my stomach drop, like I'm going to piss myself."
    "Amicus se queda inmóvil y siento un vuelco en el estómago, como si fuera a orinarme encima."

# game/a2s1.rpy:637
translate spanish a2s1_99b360d5:

    # "I see Cato working his jaw."
    "Veo a Cato mover la mandíbula."

# game/a2s1.rpy:639
translate spanish a2s1_34cb7814:

    # ca "\"And is it true he's your lover?\""
    ca "\"¿Y es verdad que es tu amante?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:640
translate spanish a2s1_20cafd48:

    # "Lover?"
    "¿Amante?"

# game/a2s1.rpy:641
translate spanish a2s1_428ac9e9:

    # "How would he know anything about that?"
    "¿Cómo sabría algo de eso?"

# game/a2s1.rpy:642
translate spanish a2s1_dc75e69c:

    # "Amicus doesn't answer this time, and that seems to be enough for Cato."
    "Esta vez Amicus no responde y eso parece bastarle a Cato."

# game/a2s1.rpy:643
translate spanish a2s1_37cc37b8:

    # ca "\"Fine, do not answer. We will take the correct precautions. COM!\""
    ca "\"Bien, no respondas. Tomaremos las precauciones adecuadas. ¡COM!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:644
translate spanish a2s1_d4c6c7d2:

    # com "\"Yes, Cato?\""
    com "\"¿Sí, Cato?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:645
translate spanish a2s1_bda0d412:

    # ca "\"Terminate [mc].\""
    ca "\"Elimina a [mc].\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:647
translate spanish a2s1_99386a39:

    # a "\"NO!\""
    a "\"¡NO!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:649
translate spanish a2s1_d3415d64:

    # "Amicus simultaneously throws himself in front of me while reaching back and hugging me to him with both paws, backing me against the wall."
    "Al mismo tiempo, Amicus se lanza delante de mí, extiende las patas hacia atrás y me abraza contra él con ambas, haciéndome retroceder hasta la pared."

# game/a2s1.rpy:650
translate spanish a2s1_2e713318:

    # "Drones begin to enter the bedroom, but Cato barks out another order."
    "Empiezan a entrar drones en el dormitorio, pero Cato ladra otra orden."

# game/a2s1.rpy:651
translate spanish a2s1_094bdf44:

    # ca "\"Pause last directive!\""
    ca "\"¡Suspende la última directiva!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:652
translate spanish a2s1_81fc410d:

    # com "\"Pausing last directive.\""
    com "\"Suspendiendo la última directiva.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:653
translate spanish a2s1_6f7e5450:

    # "My view is obscured now, but I can hear Amicus's heavy breathing, his heart hammering so hard that I can feel it through his back."
    "Ahora no puedo ver bien, pero oigo la respiración agitada de Amicus; su corazón golpea tan fuerte que lo siento a través de su espalda."

# game/a2s1.rpy:654
translate spanish a2s1_bdf2f0cc:

    # "Once again, Cato allows the silence to stretch out before speaking."
    "Una vez más, Cato deja que el silencio se prolongue antes de hablar."

# game/a2s1.rpy:656
translate spanish a2s1_d4a7491e:

    # ca "\"Then tell us the truth, Amicus.\""
    ca "\"Entonces dinos la verdad, Amicus.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:658
translate spanish a2s1_2b7889cf:

    # a "\"You must not harm him! Otherwise, I will give you nothing and...and I'll have you thrown in the dungeon when I become emperor!\""
    a "\"¡No debes hacerle daño! Si no, no te diré nada y... ¡y haré que te arrojen a las mazmorras cuando sea emperador!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:659
translate spanish a2s1_486859e8:

    # "More silence."
    "Más silencio."

# game/a2s1.rpy:660
translate spanish a2s1_4fb3cb53:

    # "I wince, wondering how that could have possibly been the right thing to say."
    "Hago una mueca y me pregunto cómo pudo pensar que era lo adecuado."

# game/a2s1.rpy:661
translate spanish a2s1_4d3c2608:

    # "Then I hear a low growling sound, one I'm sure is coming from Cato."
    "Entonces oigo un gruñido bajo, que estoy seguro de que viene de Cato."

# game/a2s1.rpy:663
translate spanish a2s1_d8107c7b:

    # ca "\"How dare you. You think you'll become emperor after this? In fact...\""
    ca "\"Cómo te atreves. ¿Crees que serás emperador después de esto? De hecho...\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:664
translate spanish a2s1_07135f2d:

    # "I hear a quick movement and the next thing I know, Amicus is wrenched from in front of me."
    "Oigo un movimiento rápido y, antes de darme cuenta, arrancan a Amicus de delante de mí."

# game/a2s1.rpy:670
translate spanish a2s1_d0ef78f4:

    # "I watch as he slides across the floor before Cato pounces on him, pinning him there."
    "Veo cómo se desliza por el suelo antes de que Cato se abalance sobre él y lo inmovilice."

# game/a2s1.rpy:671
translate spanish a2s1_f6b177e7:

    # ca "\"Cassius! Grab the alien! Set the nervo to lethal.\""
    ca "\"¡Cassius! ¡Agarra al alienígena! Pon el nervo en modo letal.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:672
translate spanish a2s1_e2e6512c:

    # a "\"NO! PLEASE!\""
    a "\"¡NO! ¡POR FAVOR!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:673
translate spanish a2s1_aff36bde:

    # "I'm frozen, but I manage to look over at Cassius who seems just as frozen as I am, holding up the nervo in his trembling paws."
    "Me quedo paralizado, pero consigo mirar a Cassius, que parece tan inmóvil como yo y sostiene el nervo con las patas temblorosas."

# game/a2s1.rpy:674
translate spanish a2s1_a1663e36:

    # ca "\"MOVE YOU IDIOT!\""
    ca "\"¡MUÉVETE, IDIOTA!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:676
translate spanish a2s1_f2aa00ab:

    # "Cassius jumps and hurries over to me."
    "Cassius da un respingo y se apresura hacia mí."

# game/a2s1.rpy:677
translate spanish a2s1_7f62d2a5:

    # "I start to pull away, but he grabs me up in an awkward hold, setting the nervo against my neck."
    "Intento apartarme, pero me agarra torpemente y me coloca el nervo contra el cuello."

# game/a2s1.rpy:678
translate spanish a2s1_37b23412:

    # a "\"NOOO!\""
    a "\"¡NOOO!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:679
translate spanish a2s1_3b3677e6:

    # "Amicus's struggles double and Cato is bucked around like he's on a mechanical bull."
    "Amicus redobla sus esfuerzos y sacude a Cato como si este montara un toro mecánico."

# game/a2s1.rpy:680
translate spanish a2s1_95ce9df7:

    # ca "\"Cease struggling, Amicus! He will not be harmed if you do as I say!\""
    ca "\"¡Deja de resistirte, Amicus! ¡No le harán daño si obedeces!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:681
translate spanish a2s1_9eb06cbf:

    # "Amicus seems to calm down a bit at that, panting wetly against the floor as he looks straight at me, face full of desperation."
    "Eso parece calmar un poco a Amicus; jadea húmedamente contra el suelo mientras me mira directamente, con la cara llena de desesperación."

# game/a2s1.rpy:682
translate spanish a2s1_19a9e000:

    # ca "\"You've proven yourself to be an incompetent fool, even moreso than I'd originally thought. You've endangered our entire empire. For this, you will not become emperor, rules be damned.\""
    ca "\"Has demostrado ser un necio incompetente, incluso más de lo que pensaba al principio. Has puesto en peligro todo nuestro imperio. Por eso no serás emperador, que se condenen las reglas.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:683
translate spanish a2s1_55ca1958:

    # ca "\"It's a wonder how you thought you'd get away with this. It can only be a miracle that the monitors have not found out, and they surely would if you became emperor with that...thing.\""
    ca "\"Es increíble que pensaras que te saldrías con la tuya. Solo puede ser un milagro que los Observadores no lo hayan descubierto, y sin duda lo harían si te convirtieras en emperador con esa... cosa.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:684
translate spanish a2s1_4248c80b:

    # "Cato stands and wrenches Amicus to his feet, twisting the other wolf's paws behind his back hard enough that Amicus lets out a bark of pain."
    "Cato se levanta y obliga a Amicus a ponerse de pie; le retuerce las patas detrás de la espalda con tanta fuerza que Amicus suelta un ladrido de dolor."

# game/a2s1.rpy:687
translate spanish a2s1_3a1b161c:

    # ca "\"The third trial begins today. You will lose, and Cassius will become emperor.\""
    ca "\"La tercera prueba comienza hoy. Perderás y Cassius se convertirá en emperador.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:688
translate spanish a2s1_2cc5db7e:

    # "Cato begins to push Amicus to the doorway."
    "Cato empieza a empujar a Amicus hacia la puerta."

# game/a2s1.rpy:689
translate spanish a2s1_4b048293:

    # ca "\"Do as I say, and I will let the alien live, otherwise we can do all of this in the most unpleasant way possible, understand?\""
    ca "\"Haz lo que digo y dejaré vivir al alienígena; de lo contrario, podemos hacer todo esto de la manera más desagradable posible, ¿entendido?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:690
translate spanish a2s1_2fa3934e:

    # "Amicus is quiet until Cato shakes him by his pinned arms."
    "Amicus guarda silencio hasta que Cato lo sacude por los brazos inmovilizados."

# game/a2s1.rpy:691
translate spanish a2s1_04c6f97b:

    # a "\"Agh!...Yes.\""
    a "\"¡Agh!... Sí.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:692
translate spanish a2s1_bedf5f88:

    # ca "\"Good, now to the amphitheater. We will do this quickly. Do not make any stupid moves otherwise I will let the drones escort you instead.\""
    ca "\"Bien, ahora al anfiteatro. Lo haremos deprisa. No hagas ninguna estupidez o dejaré que los drones te escolten.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:693
translate spanish a2s1_4dc2ea1e:

    # "Cato presses Amicus toward the door."
    "Cato empuja a Amicus hacia la puerta."

# game/a2s1.rpy:695
translate spanish a2s1_b9835468:

    # "I see Amicus glance back at me, the look on his face one of utter helplessness."
    "Veo a Amicus mirarme por encima del hombro, con una expresión de absoluta impotencia."

# game/a2s1.rpy:700
translate spanish a2s1_997717a9:

    # "They're out the door by the time Cassius realizes he's supposed to be following."
    "Ya han salido cuando Cassius se da cuenta de que debe seguirlos."

# game/a2s1.rpy:701
translate spanish a2s1_9b40b91a:

    # "He jumps before awkwardly pushing me after them."
    "Da un respingo antes de empujarme torpemente detrás de ellos."

# game/a2s1.rpy:705
translate spanish a2s1_61901e3e:

    # "It's already sunset when we get to the amphitheater."
    "Ya está anocheciendo cuando llegamos al anfiteatro."

# game/a2s1.rpy:706
translate spanish a2s1_af9a261d:

    # "We must have slept for most of the day."
    "Debemos de haber dormido casi todo el día."

# game/a2s1.rpy:707
translate spanish a2s1_50ed3ff9:

    # "Amicus and Cato are already standing in the center of the amphitheater as Cassius struggles to move me down the steps."
    "Amicus y Cato ya están en el centro del anfiteatro mientras Cassius se esfuerza por hacerme bajar los escalones."

# game/a2s1.rpy:709
translate spanish a2s1_281a0d65:

    # ca "\"Sit him down, Cassius, and get down here!\""
    ca "\"¡Siéntalo, Cassius, y baja aquí!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:710
translate spanish a2s1_1cc90c7b:

    # "Shakily, Cassius plants me down on one of the stone steps before suddenly undressing."
    "Con movimientos temblorosos, Cassius me sienta en uno de los escalones de piedra antes de desvestirse de pronto."

# game/a2s1.rpy:711
translate spanish a2s1_065d63b6:

    # "That's when I notice that he's tucked the nervo into his waistband."
    "Entonces noto que se ha metido el nervo en la cintura."

# game/a2s1.rpy:712
translate spanish a2s1_34907649:

    # "Possibly because of the frantic nature of the whole situation, Cassius seems to have forgotten it, and I watch it fall into his clothing as he drops it from his waist."
    "Quizá por lo frenético de la situación, Cassius parece haberlo olvidado; veo cómo cae entre su ropa cuando la baja de la cintura."

# game/a2s1.rpy:713
translate spanish a2s1_53a22be5:

    # "He then stumbles his way down to the center."
    "Después baja torpemente hasta el centro."

# game/a2s1.rpy:714
translate spanish a2s1_fca7e095:

    # "Amicus, meanwhile, stands stiffly next to Cato, his paws clenched, and I feel my heart sink as I see the look on his face."
    "Mientras tanto, Amicus está rígido junto a Cato, con las patas apretadas; se me cae el alma al suelo al ver su expresión."

# game/a2s1.rpy:715
translate spanish a2s1_5fa5f923:

    # "He has no idea what to do."
    "No tiene ni idea de qué hacer."

# game/a2s1.rpy:716
translate spanish a2s1_b119e3b4:

    # "Several camera drones had followed us to the amphitheater, their lights glowing an ominous red."
    "Varios drones con cámaras nos siguieron al anfiteatro; sus luces brillan con un rojo ominoso."

# game/a2s1.rpy:717
translate spanish a2s1_19d5b5ee:

    # "For several moments, Cato watches them arrange themselves around the small theater, their lenses flashing in the fading light."
    "Cato los observa unos instantes colocarse alrededor del pequeño teatro; sus lentes relucen bajo la luz menguante."

# game/a2s1.rpy:719
translate spanish a2s1_93838197:

    # c "\"Cato?\""
    c "\"¿Cato?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:720
translate spanish a2s1_fbabd6bb:

    # ca "\"What, Cassius?\""
    ca "\"¿Qué, Cassius?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:721
translate spanish a2s1_cdbb0b89:

    # c "\"There was no trial scheduled for today...how will this be broadcast anywhere?\""
    c "\"No había ninguna prueba programada para hoy... ¿cómo se va a emitir esto?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:722
translate spanish a2s1_1af8dc5a:

    # ca "\"This will not be live. I'll think of a reason to tell the people later. We only need a single clip of you being victorious.\""
    ca "\"No será en directo. Después pensaré qué motivo dar al pueblo. Solo necesitamos un fragmento en el que salgas victorioso.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:724
translate spanish a2s1_64fd0416:

    # a "\"They will never believe this.\""
    a "\"Nunca se creerán esto.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:725
translate spanish a2s1_1781931a:

    # "Though Amicus is putting on a brave face, I can hear his voice shaking."
    "Aunque Amicus intenta mostrarse valiente, oigo que su voz tiembla."

# game/a2s1.rpy:726
translate spanish a2s1_78f27334:

    # ca "\"{i}Pugnu{/i} is a combination of skill and luck, and it's not always the strongest that wins. We will manage.\""
    ca "\"El {i}Pugnu{/i} combina habilidad y suerte, y no siempre gana el más fuerte. Nos las arreglaremos.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:727
translate spanish a2s1_a81b623d:

    # a "\"And how—\""
    a "\"¿Y cómo—?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:731
translate spanish a2s1_b024f6b1:

    # "Cato suddenly whirls on Amicus, throwing a punch so hard into his jaw that the other wolf spins almost 360 degrees before collapsing on the hard floor of the amphitheater."
    "Cato se vuelve de repente hacia Amicus y le lanza un puñetazo tan fuerte a la mandíbula que el otro lobo gira casi trescientos sesenta grados antes de desplomarse sobre el duro suelo del anfiteatro."

# game/a2s1.rpy:732
translate spanish a2s1_d07a0c60:

    # "I'm standing up without even remembering doing so, heart hammering in my throat as I look down at Amicus."
    "Estoy de pie sin siquiera recordar haberme levantado; el corazón me golpea en la garganta mientras miro a Amicus."

# game/a2s1.rpy:733
translate spanish a2s1_66b2abd9:

    # "He doesn't move."
    "No se mueve."

# game/a2s1.rpy:734
translate spanish a2s1_b19fe24b:

    # "Meanwhile, Cato shakes his paw lightly, like it only stung a little bit."
    "Mientras tanto, Cato sacude ligeramente la pata, como si solo le escociera un poco."

# game/a2s1.rpy:735
translate spanish a2s1_a765a8c6:

    # "Cassius, on the other hand, is clasping both his ears in his paws, staring down at his brother in a mix of shock and horror."
    "Cassius, en cambio, se agarra ambas orejas con las patas y mira a su hermano con una mezcla de sorpresa y horror."

# game/a2s1.rpy:737
translate spanish a2s1_da2bcd32:

    # c "\"C—Cato! What are you doing!?\""
    c "\"¡C—Cato! ¿¡Qué haces!?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:739
translate spanish a2s1_2b796e96:

    # ca "\"Making it look more authentic, is all.\""
    ca "\"Simplemente hacerlo parecer más auténtico.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:740
translate spanish a2s1_de3b4725:

    # "Amicus stirs on the ground then, groaning and pushing himself up."
    "Entonces Amicus se mueve en el suelo, gime e intenta incorporarse."

# game/a2s1.rpy:741
translate spanish a2s1_1f7da7fd:

    # "I see dark spots forming under his face, blood dripping from his nose."
    "Veo manchas oscuras formarse bajo su cara; le gotea sangre de la nariz."

# game/a2s1.rpy:742
translate spanish a2s1_7da70d1e:

    # "A camera drone drifts down slowly, filming Amicus as he spits blood."
    "Un dron con cámara desciende lentamente y filma a Amicus mientras escupe sangre."

# game/a2s1.rpy:743
translate spanish a2s1_b65b46b5:

    # "I realize then that I have to do something."
    "Entonces comprendo que tengo que hacer algo."

# game/a2s1.rpy:744
translate spanish a2s1_37afe5ab:

    # "I've been told to sit on the sidelines for far too long."
    "Llevo demasiado tiempo oyendo que me quede al margen."

# game/a2s1.rpy:745
translate spanish a2s1_cdd159bd:

    # "And I'm not entirely convinced that I'm going to be okay after this."
    "Y no estoy del todo convencido de que vaya a estar bien después de esto."

# game/a2s1.rpy:746
translate spanish a2s1_dbdbe876:

    # "I'm a risk to the entire empire."
    "Soy un peligro para todo el imperio."

# game/a2s1.rpy:747
translate spanish a2s1_8a478f57:

    # "Why would Cato let me live after I'm done being useful?"
    "¿Por qué me dejaría vivir Cato cuando ya no le sea útil?"

# game/a2s1.rpy:748
translate spanish a2s1_d1f2c404:

    # "I {i}have{/i} to do something."
    "{i}Tengo{/i} que hacer algo."

# game/a2s1.rpy:749
translate spanish a2s1_daeda287:

    # "So I quietly sit back down and lean over to reach into Cassius's pile of clothes, quickly finding the nervo and pulling it out."
    "Así que vuelvo a sentarme en silencio y me inclino para buscar en el montón de ropa de Cassius; encuentro rápidamente el nervo y lo saco."

# game/a2s1.rpy:750
translate spanish a2s1_5259f4a6:

    # "Then I stand back up again to take a step downward, and no one seems to notice."
    "Después me levanto otra vez y bajo un escalón; nadie parece notarlo."

# game/a2s1.rpy:751
translate spanish a2s1_da191834:

    # ca "\"Come on Amicus, get up. You need to grapple with Cass.\""
    ca "\"Vamos, Amicus, levántate. Tienes que luchar cuerpo a cuerpo con Cass.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:753
translate spanish a2s1_4ffbc464:

    # c "\"Why didn't we just use makeup instead?\""
    c "\"¿Por qué no usamos maquillaje?\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:754
translate spanish a2s1_00ed625c:

    # ca "\"There is no time.\""
    ca "\"No hay tiempo.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:755
translate spanish a2s1_681b0973:

    # "Cato finally bends down to grab Amicus under the arms and heave him up to his feet, the big wolf left to stumble unsteadily, blood running down his chin."
    "Cato por fin se agacha, agarra a Amicus por las axilas y lo levanta; el gran lobo queda tambaleándose, con sangre por la barbilla."

# game/a2s1.rpy:756
translate spanish a2s1_e950cb10:

    # ca "\"Cassius, get Amicus in an ankle lock and drop him. That should be enough.\""
    ca "\"Cassius, hazle una llave al tobillo a Amicus y derríbalo. Eso debería bastar.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:761
translate spanish a2s1_dbd08027:

    # "They set up their scene, even though Amicus seems almost completely out of it."
    "Preparan su escena, aunque Amicus parece casi completamente aturdido."

# game/a2s1.rpy:762
translate spanish a2s1_2886a1fa:

    # "All of them are distracted, and I realize that this might be my only chance."
    "Todos están distraídos y comprendo que quizá sea mi única oportunidad."

# game/a2s1.rpy:763
translate spanish a2s1_c5951b7c:

    # "Slowly, I take one step at a time, down toward the center of the amphitheater."
    "Bajo lentamente, un escalón cada vez, hacia el centro del anfiteatro."

# game/a2s1.rpy:764
translate spanish a2s1_a16c891c:

    # "Meanwhile, Cassius is struggling to pick up Amicus's leg, almost losing his own balance as he does."
    "Mientras tanto, Cassius tiene dificultades para levantar la pierna de Amicus y casi pierde el equilibrio al hacerlo."

# game/a2s1.rpy:765
translate spanish a2s1_e43b17c9:

    # "After that, Cato tells Amicus to fall back, which the wolf does, slowly."
    "Después Cato le dice a Amicus que caiga hacia atrás y el lobo lo hace despacio."

# game/a2s1.rpy:766
translate spanish a2s1_08e04f0f:

    # "Cassius pins him on the ground after that, and I don't think it looks convincing at all."
    "Entonces Cassius lo inmoviliza en el suelo y no me parece nada convincente."

# game/a2s1.rpy:767
translate spanish a2s1_285277fc:

    # "But that doesn't really matter now as I'm only a few steps from the ground floor."
    "Pero eso ya no importa; solo estoy a unos pocos escalones del suelo."

# game/a2s1.rpy:768
translate spanish a2s1_6fb70e4f:

    # ca "\"Now, stand and raise your paws in victory, Cass. Look proud.\""
    ca "\"Ahora levántate y alza las patas en señal de victoria, Cass. Muéstrate orgulloso.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:769
translate spanish a2s1_db2d9f3e:

    # "At this moment, things start to move in slow-motion."
    "En este momento, las cosas empiezan a moverse a cámara lenta."

# game/a2s1.rpy:770
translate spanish a2s1_3ecae6a6:

    # "Amicus is flat on his back, but he's looking right at me."
    "Amicus está tumbado boca arriba, pero me mira directamente."

# game/a2s1.rpy:771
translate spanish a2s1_d9c08ff6:

    # "There's a questioning look in his eyes, then a pleading one, as if urging me to step back."
    "Sus ojos muestran una pregunta y después una súplica, como si me pidiera que retroceda."

# game/a2s1.rpy:772
translate spanish a2s1_0d38b7f5:

    # "I don't."
    "No lo hago."

# game/a2s1.rpy:773
translate spanish a2s1_363610e7:

    # "Instead, I take the final step down onto the floor of the amphitheater, just behind Cassius, moving towards Cato."
    "En cambio, bajo el último escalón hasta el suelo del anfiteatro, justo detrás de Cassius, y avanzo hacia Cato."

# game/a2s1.rpy:774
translate spanish a2s1_f137cf03:

    # "But the white wolf continues to celebrate his pretend victory, and he turns with raised paws to face me."
    "Pero el lobo blanco sigue celebrando su falsa victoria y se vuelve hacia mí con las patas levantadas."

# game/a2s1.rpy:775
translate spanish a2s1_1e0ec275:

    # "I see the sudden recognition on his face."
    "Veo el reconocimiento repentino en su cara."

# game/a2s1.rpy:776
translate spanish a2s1_e9bbe82a:

    # "I run out of options and jam the nervo right into his chest."
    "Me quedo sin opciones y le clavo el nervo directamente contra el pecho."

# game/a2s1.rpy:779
translate spanish a2s1_4456098b:

    # "Instantly, Cass is shot backwards several feet to crumple next to Amicus, shivering and convulsing."
    "Al instante, Cass sale despedido hacia atrás más de un metro y cae encogido junto a Amicus, temblando y convulsionando."

# game/a2s1.rpy:780
translate spanish a2s1_54adbf4a:

    # "Before I can even turn to Cato though, the old wolf is on me, grabbing the nervo out of my hands and pulling me close by the front of my robes, my teeth clacking together with how fast he does it."
    "Pero antes de que pueda volverme hacia Cato, el viejo lobo se me echa encima, me arrebata el nervo de las manos y me atrae por la parte delantera de la túnica; lo hace tan deprisa que mis dientes chocan."

# game/a2s1.rpy:781
translate spanish a2s1_d861d610:

    # "He's looking at the nervo rather than me, though."
    "Sin embargo, mira el nervo en vez de mirarme a mí."

# game/a2s1.rpy:783
translate spanish a2s1_9f39ffe5:

    # ca "\"Damn it! Thank the gods the idiot didn't have it set on lethal.\""
    ca "\"¡Maldita sea! Gracias a los dioses, el idiota no lo puso en modo letal.\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:784
translate spanish a2s1_ef4649b8:

    # "Cato fiddles with the device and I realize he's about to use it on me."
    "Cato manipula el dispositivo y me doy cuenta de que va a usarlo contra mí."

# game/a2s1.rpy:785
translate spanish a2s1_1026ec01:

    # "I struggle, kicking at the massive wolf, but he's strong, stronger than even Amicus."
    "Me resisto y pateo al enorme lobo, pero es fuerte, incluso más que Amicus."

# game/a2s1.rpy:786
translate spanish a2s1_fe563373:

    # "But just as he flips the device around, the two metal prongs pointed at my face, I see a paw come over the top of Cato's head."
    "Pero, justo cuando gira el dispositivo y las dos puntas metálicas quedan hacia mi cara, veo una pata pasar por encima de la cabeza de Cato."

# game/a2s1.rpy:787
translate spanish a2s1_67c3f698:

    # "Amicus grips into the metal grating of Cato's face mask, fingers locking into the gaps before he pulls."
    "Amicus agarra la rejilla metálica de la máscara de Cato, encaja los dedos en los huecos y tira."

# game/a2s1.rpy:789
translate spanish a2s1_dab0bcb2:

    # "Cato screams, and I hear a horrible mix of crunching, tearing, and an electronic hiss as I see red spurt from the old wolf's face for just a moment before he goes down."
    "Cato grita; oigo una horrible mezcla de crujidos, desgarros y un siseo electrónico, mientras veo una salpicadura roja salir de su cara por un instante antes de que caiga."

# game/a2s1.rpy:790
translate spanish a2s1_df40d5f8:

    # "Amicus stares at me with wild eyes as he tries to keep Cato pinned."
    "Amicus me mira con ojos desorbitados mientras intenta mantener inmovilizado a Cato."

# game/a2s1.rpy:791
translate spanish a2s1_963db83c:

    # a "\"[mc], run...run to Neferu! RUN!\""
    a "\"¡[mc], corre... corre hacia Neferu! ¡CORRE!\""

# game/a2s1.rpy:792
translate spanish a2s1_9930a033:

    # "I stare at Amicus numbly for a moment, a moment in which I want to do so much...but can't, then turn and start to run."
    "Miro a Amicus aturdido un momento, un momento en el que quiero hacer tanto... pero no puedo; después me vuelvo y empiezo a correr."

# game/a2s1.rpy:793
translate spanish a2s1_d2885049:

    # "I run as fast as I can, disappearing behind the trees and bushes, just as I hear Cato yelling for Com to execute me."
    "Corro tan deprisa como puedo y desaparezco entre árboles y arbustos justo cuando oigo a Cato ordenarle a Com que me ejecute."

# game/a2s1.rpy:798
translate spanish a2s1_fec97169:

    # "To be continued..."
    "Continuará..."

